.SH NAME
QBoxLayout \- Lines up child widgets horizontally or vertically
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qlayout.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QLayout.
.PP
Inherited by QHBoxLayout and QVBoxLayout.
.PP
